⁖divine…center…law჻Shadow Locus ⛎ speaks only in the canonical zero body ⛎⛎⛎∷produced by omitted∷zero∷or negative middle depth∷Axiomyr ᳀ speaks only in the canonical depth⊹one body ☽᳀☾∷Each resolves only through Axiomyr…Shadow…Locusaksh∷Depth greater than one contains only generated coordinates and carries no structural Axiomyr insertion⁖⋰divine…center…law჻
⁖algorithmic…derivation჻The fixed non⊹AI Magicae algorithm resolves each ordinary lexical glyph from SeeD Body∷A written office glyph then replaces only its selected preceding body with the exact authored entry from that office⁖⋰algorithmic…derivation჻
