⁖runtime჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍1𝇎჻Read the exact Aeonic line in visible order exactly as GrimChain generated it∷beginning at the first written glyph∷No generated coordinate is remissed∷replaced∷or rewritten before Sydonic⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍2𝇎჻Collect each maximal consecutive run of visible grammar glyphs as one ordered stack without imposing a numerical stack⊹depth ceiling⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍3𝇎჻Resolve every ordinary lexical glyph through SeeD Body from the beginning of the Aeonic line⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍4𝇎჻Apply each written office glyph only to its selected preceding lexical body using that office’s exact authored body⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍5𝇎჻If required spoken history∷an authored office inventory∷or the selected glyph entry is absent∷stop explicitly⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍6𝇎჻Ordinary office runs remain additive on their immediately preceding lexical glyph unless they enter an Ouroborose Loop∷⚶ resolves its complete unresolved Loop topology before utterance expansion∷ཪ remains its separate authored Phantasmagoria Transmutation law and is not rewritten by Ouroborose execution⁖⋰step჻
⁖step order⧟𝇍7𝇎჻Render the completed utterance into the requested receiving language∷Resolve ⛎ through Axiomyr…Shadow…Locusaksh only for the canonical zero body ⛎⛎⛎ and resolve ᳀ through it only for canonical depth one ☽᳀☾∷Outside those special whole⊹GrimChain bodies they remain structural presence and are not ordinary lexical words⁖⋰step჻
